<title>USA: AlliedSignal sees $540 mln in order revenues.</title>
<headline>AlliedSignal sees $540 mln in order revenues.</headline>
<dateline>TORRANCE, Calif. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>AlliedSignal Aerospace said Wednesday it expects to generate $540 million in revenues from orders at the Farnborough Air Show in England.</p>
<p>The orders are for equipment and systems, aftermarket spares, and repair and overhaul services, the company said.</p>
<p>The air show took place earlier this month near London.</p>
<p>AlliedSignal Aerospace is a unit of AlliedSignal Inc.</p>
</text>
